    <apiVersion>67.0</apiVersion>
    <description>ConstructConnect feed leads. On Status = New with Lead Source = ConstructConnect: checks the brand vertical, threshold and phase rules, matches or creates the Project and writes the Project and Project Name back to the lead (a matched project supplies its own name; a new project uses the lead Project Name, else the Last Name), holds brands already in pursuit, routes owner and territory per Routing Rule, sets Status and Match Result, and notifies the brand leader when the construction value is over the brand Strategic Threshold. Creates no leads.</description>
